{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13143","headline":"玄元观送李源李风还奉先华阴 · 皇甫冉","name":"玄元观送李源李风还奉先华阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此去那知道路遥，寒原紫府上迢迢。\n莫辞别酒和琼液，乍唱离歌和凤箫。\n远水东流浮落景，缭垣西转失行镳。\n华山秦塞长相忆，无使音尘顿寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}